{"text":"**Implementing storage solutions**

I need to focus on how to implement the storage solution. It's important to note that we shouldn’t require backend services — just durable localStorage in the browser will suffice, so no cross-user data is involved. While the UI benefits could include a map, photography isn't necessary. It might be beneficial to use an icon to represent skills, but I’m not sure if Lucide is explicitly needed. Oh, and I need to read files as well.

