I need to add the lucide-react package using pnpm. I think it would be best to manage everything in one app, around 1200 lines. I'll aim for a responsive design for both mobile and desktop, and I need to plan for user interactions. Offline capability is important too, so I might use local storage and implement geolocation as well. I need to avoid any fake communications, so explicit labeling will be essential. It’s time to install that dependency!

